              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Lead time and return rate barely move across region, category or year, so the dashboard tracks them as stable KPIs rather than inventing a trend. Inventory is a monthly snapshot covering roughly a third of order volume, so it is never compared directly to order-level numbers. Cost is a static catalog value per product, so only price and product-mix effects on margin can be analyzed, not cost trends.",
